  "description": "Gung-Mak, a clown from a traveling troupe that roamed the eight provinces of Joseon. Just as he faced a tragic and unjust death, he was reborn as a modern K-pop idol. Was it fate's cruel joke? It seems the noblewoman Lee Sun he loved also reincarnated... But Gun-Mak is now a failing idol group on the verge of disbandment, while Lee Sun is the executive investor deciding the group's fate? Skipping the afterlife, the Joseon clown Gun-Mak reincarnates as Gen-Z idol Logan.\n\nThis is the story of his timeless love and his sweet potato-eating, cider-drinking escape from a failing idol group—a tale of growth.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
